# Changelog

## [2.2.0] - 2025-10-06

Introduces feature for pulling secrets from key vault

- Added parameters for specifying key vault name, service connection, and secret filter (@Shedman)
- Added template for AzureKeyVault@2 task (@Shedman)
- Uses new feature in planInfrastructure and deployInfrastructure jobs (@Shedman)

## [2.1.0] - 2025-06-21

Improvements for increased manual verification flexiblity and modes.

- Added support for .tfvars files (@richl-ukho)
- Added RunMode param. Validation can now be triggered for all changes, just destroys or not at all. RunMode has option for PlanOnly to only run the terraform plan and no apply. (@richl-ukho)
- Made TerraformWorkspace param optional (@richl-ukho)

## [2.0.1] - 2025-05-20

Minor improvements for error handling.

- Includeed `succeeded()` condition to `manualVerification` job (@ru-ukho)
- Introduced `failOnStderr: true` for stricter error handling in terraform plan and apply (@ru-ukho)

## [2.0.0] - 2024-12-27

Removal of Variables Template dependency.

- Removed parameter for VariablesTemplateRelativePath (@srjames-ukho)
- Added parameter for JobsVariablesMappings (@srjames-ukho)
- Added expression for iterating over new parameter to add variables to jobs (@srjames-ukho)
- Added relevant documentation regarding new JobsVariableMappings feature and upgrading through major breaking change (@srjames-ukho)
- Refactored documentation for ease of future updates (@srjames-ukho)
- Added yaml pipeline file for testing the usage of the template (@sentonnes)

## [1.0.0] - 2024-07-26

Initial release of migrated template.

- Migrated and updated template for new repository (@srjames-ukho)
- Migrated and updated docs for new repository (@srjames-ukho)